Name Kuwait Note #1

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Big Man's Will
Interactability_Text_Line_1 Date: Juneuary 7st, 19XX
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Dear family, I hope this note finds you in good health and dignity-
Interactability_Text_Line_3 because I am not. As I write this, the special forces are closing in
Interactability_Text_Line_4 on my abode, as I cower in the sewers below. 
Interactability_Text_Line_5 I thought I could get away with laundering unspeakable amounts through the bank I have built up,
Interactability_Text_Line_6 but that is not the case. In my final moments, I leave you, my 83 sons 
Interactability_Text_Line_7 and 2 daughters, the business of Big Man's Baller Bank. God speed. 